+- `python3 research/checks/verify_momentum_cost_sensitivity.py`: Gate 1 PASS — all 120 recomputations (3 lookbacks × 4 cost levels × 10 assets) MATCH the artifact on medians, null medians, and regenerated verdicts; Gate 2 PASS — recomputation deterministic across two full reruns; conclusion VERIFIED.
+- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v`: 168 tests, all passing.
 
